The ReSTIR story's RIS weights, pick, and W
===========================================

What the story draws on the canvas (lab/src/math/) for chapter 2's beat `c2-ris-math`, stage by stage as
its stage (`stepOf "weights" 13`, the clips below) goes from 0 to 13: P's eight candidates in the math scenes' example world (examples.rs, the lab's
illustration; the same eight the next beats stream through a reservoir) in a table of their target p-hat, the
probability p they were drawn with, and their weight w = p-hat / p, each weight a bar beside its row; the pick in
proportion to the weights, on the weights laid end to end; the correction, the average of the weights; and W, the
average weight over the kept candidate's target, and the light at P, what it brings times W.

$[Import* std]
$[Import* render_lab_runtime]
$[Import* render_lab_math]
$[Import* paper_restir_values]
$[Import* paper_restir_natives]
$[Import* paper_restir_common]

The candidates

The example's stream: the seed WRS's beat uses too (script/wrs.lam), so the candidates are the same.
$[# _seed 10]
The table's place, and the size of its text.
$[# _tableAt [% {v2 -4.4 0.5}]]
$[# _size 0.46]
The right column, where the formulas go.
$[# _right [% {v2 3.6 0.0}]]

Fn([List({kept: Int, light: Int, p: Float, pHat: Float, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, wsum: Float})], Table).
The table of the candidates: x_i, p-hat, p, w.
$[# {_table steps}
    [# header {'
        {tex "hx" "" _size textColor}
        {tex "hpHat" f"{\hat p}" _size targetColor}
        {tex "hp" "p" _size pColor}
        {tex "hw" "w" _size weightColor}}]
    [# rows {map
        {range 0 {length steps}}
        {^ {i}
            [# s {nth steps i}]
            {'
                {tex f"{x${str i}}" f"{x_{${str {+ i 1}}}}" _size textColor}
                {tex f"{pHat${str i}}" {short {.pHat s}} _size targetColor}
                {tex f"{p${str i}}" {short {.p s}} _size pColor}
                {tex f"{w${str i}}" {short {.w s}} _size weightColor}}}}]
    {tableShifted {table "table" {cons header rows} 0.11 textDimColor} _tableAt}]


Fn([Table, List({kept: Int, light: Int, p: Float, pHat: Float, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, wsum: Float})], List(Mob)).
Each candidate's weight as a bar to the right of its row, as long as the weight over the largest.
$[# {_bars t steps}
    [# top {fold {map steps .w} 0.000001 max}]
    [# x0 {+ {.x {.hi {nth {nth {.boxes t} 0} 3}}} 0.25}]
    {flatten {map
        {range 0 {length steps}}
        {^ {i}
            [# y {.y {boxCenter {nth {nth {.boxes t} {+ i 1}} 3}}}]
            {filled f"{bar${str i}}"
                {box {v2 x0 {- y 0.16}} {v2 {+ x0 {* 2.2 {/ {.w {nth steps i}} top}}} {+ y 0.16}}}
                weightColor
                0.85}}}}]
Bars grown from the left one after another.
$[# _barsIn [% {: {^ {t f}
    [# n {length f}]
    {flatten {map
        {range 0 n}
        {^ {i} {growFrom
            {lagged t i n 0.15}
            {' {nth f i}}
            left}}}}} {Fn {' Float {List Mob}} {List Mob}}}]]
Fn([Table], List(List(Mob))). The table's cells by whether they are its weights (the last column): the others,
then the weights.
$[# {_cellsSplit t}
    [# rows {range 0 {length {.cells t}}}]
    {'
        {flatten {map rows {^ {r} {flatten {map {range 0 3} {^ {c} {cellOf t r c}}}}}}}
        {flatten {map rows {^ {r} {cellOf t r 3}}}}}]
Fn([Table], Fn([Float], List(Mob))). The table, its weights written over the second step (its figure in the
score: the part's entry writes the rest over the first).
$[# {_tableShown t} {^ {s}
    [# split {_cellsSplit t}]
    {flatten {' {.rules t} {nth split 0} {write {phase s 1.4 2.0} {nth split 1}}}}}]
Fn([Table], Fn([Float, List(Mob)], List(Mob))). The table written over its first step: its rules and the
candidates' p-hat and p; its weights, which the figure writes, passed on as they are.
$[# {_tableIn t} {^ {u f}
    [# weights {map {nth {_cellsSplit t} 1} idOf}]
    [# {_isWeight m} {any weights {^ {i} {= i {idOf m}}}}]
    {flatten {'
        {create {phase u 0.0 0.3} {.rules t}}
        {write u {nth {_cellsSplit t} 0}}
        {filter f _isWeight}}}}]

The scene

Fn([List({kept: Int, light: Int, p: Float, pHat: Float, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, wsum: Float}), List({kept: Int, light: Int, p: Float, pHat: Float, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, wsum: Float})], Score).
P's candidates as a score of 13 steps, its eight candidates and the first sixteen of the same stream (for "however
many"): the table and the weights, the pick by the shares, what the kept one's estimate needs, and W.
$[# {_score steps sixteen}
    [# n {length steps}]
    [# t {_table steps}]
    [# often {fold
        {range 0 n}
        0
        {^ {best i} {!if {> {.p {nth steps i}} {.p {nth steps best}}} i best}}}]
    [# weights {map steps .w}]
    [# total {fold weights 0.0 +}]
    [# kept {.kept {nth steps {- n 1}}}]
    [# keptStep {nth steps kept}]
    [# starts {runningSums weights}]
    [# u {/ {lerp {nth starts kept} {nth starts {+ kept 1}} 0.5} total}]
    [# {_point ids} {^ {t f} {pointParts t f ids accentColor}}]
    [# weightRule {moveTo
        {texParts "rule" f"{\lit{1}{w} = \frac{\lit{2}{\hat p(x)}}{\lit{3}{p(x)}}}" 0.48 textColor
            {' "w" "pHat" "p"}
            {' weightColor targetColor pColor}}
        {add2 _right {v2 0.0 3.3}}}]
    [# stripBox {box {v2 {- {.x _right} 2.2} 1.1} {v2 {+ {.x _right} 2.2} 1.45}}]
    [# segments {flatten {strip "shares" weights stripBox
        {' weightColor [% {rgb "#c4569a"}]}
        0.03}}]
    [# ux {lerp {.x {.lo stripBox}} {.x {.hi stripBox}} u}]
    [# {_pick s}
        [# drop {smooth {phase s 5.4 5.8}}]
        {append
            {arrowLine "pick"
                {v2 ux {+ {.y {.hi stripBox}} {lerp 0.9 0.5 drop}}}
                {v2 ux {+ {.y {.hi stripBox}} {lerp 0.5 0.05 drop}}}
                accentColor
                3.0}
            {moveTo
                {tex "pickU" "u" 0.36 textColor}
                {v2 ux {+ {.y {.hi stripBox}} {lerp 1.1 0.7 drop}}}}}]
    [# rowBoxes {nth {.boxes t} {+ kept 1}}]
    [# keptRow {outlined "keptRow"
        {padded {fold {tail rowBoxes} {head rowBoxes} boxUnion} 0.04}
        targetColor
        2.5}]
    [# keptName {moveTo
        {tex "keptName" f"{y = x_{${str {+ kept 1}}}}" 0.44 targetColor}
        {add2 _right {v2 0.0 0.55}}}]
    [# asIf {moveTo
        {texParts "asIf" f"{\frac{\lit{1}{f(y)}}{\lit{2}{\hat p(y)}}}" 0.48 textColor
            {' "f" "pHat"}
            {' targetColor targetColor}}
        {add2 _right {v2 0.0 -0.55}}}]
    [# mean8 {/ total {float n}}]
    [# mean16 {/ {fold {map sixteen .w} 0.0 +} {float {length sixteen}}}]
    [# {_corr m count} {moveTo
        {texParts "corr" f"{\frac{1}{\lit{1}{$count}} \sum \lit{2}{w_i} = \lit{3}{${short m}}}" 0.44 textColor
            {' "M" "w" "v"}
            {' textColor weightColor estimateColor}}
        {add2 _right {v2 0.0 -1.7}}}]
    [# ring {outlined "wRing"
        {padded {boxOf {flatten {map {range 1 {+ n 1}} {^ {r} {cellOf t r 3}}}}} 0.08}
        weightColor
        2.5}]
    [# w {/ mean8 {.pHat keptStep}}]
    [# big {moveTo
        {texParts "W" f"{\lit{1}{W} = \frac{\lit{2}{\sum w_i}}{\lit{3}{M}\,\lit{4}{\hat p(y)}} = \frac{\lit{5}{${short total}}}{\lit{6}{${str n}} \cdot \lit{7}{${short {.pHat keptStep}}}} = \lit{8}{${short w}}}" 0.44 textColor
            {' "Wname" "sum" "M" "pHat" "sumV" "MV" "pHatV" "Wv"}
            {' estimateColor weightColor textColor targetColor weightColor textColor targetColor
                estimateColor}}
        {add2 _right {v2 0.0 -1.7}}}]
    [# light {moveTo
        {texParts "L" f"{L = \lit{1}{f(y)} \cdot \lit{2}{W} = \lit{3}{${short {.pHat keptStep}}} \cdot \lit{4}{${short w}} = \lit{5}{${short {* {.pHat keptStep} w}}}}" 0.44 textColor
            {' "f" "W" "fV" "WV" "L"}
            {' targetColor estimateColor targetColor estimateColor totalColor}}
        {add2 _right {v2 0.0 -2.9}}}]
    [# {_leaves} {exitOver 10.7 0.3 fadeOut}]
    {score "weights" 13
        {'
            {part "keptRow" {^ {s} keptRow} {' {enterOver 5.7 0.3 create}}}
            {part "table"
                {_tableShown t}
                {'
                    {enterOver 0.0 1.0 {_tableIn t}}
                    {emphasize 2.0 3.0 {_point {' f"{p${str often}}" f"{w${str often}}"}}}
                    {emphasize 4.0 5.0 {^ {t f} {circumscribe t f accentColor}}}
                    {emphasize 7.0 8.0 {_point {' "hp"}}}}}
            {part "rule" {^ {s} weightRule} {' {enterOver 1.0 0.6 write}}}
            {part "bars" {^ {s} {_bars t steps}} {' {enterOver 3.0 0.9 _barsIn}}}
            {part "shares" {^ {s} segments} {' {enterOver 5.0 0.4 {^ {t f} {growFrom t f left}}}}}
            {part "pick" _pick {' {enterOver 5.4 0.2 fadeIn}}}
            {part "keptName" {^ {s} keptName} {' {enterOver 5.8 0.2 fadeIn}}}
            {part "asIf"
                {^ {s} asIf}
                {' {enterOver 6.0 0.6 write} {emphasize 10.0 11.0 {_point {' "pHat"}}} {_leaves}}}
            {part "wRing" {^ {s} ring} {' {enterOver 8.0 0.4 create} {_leaves}}}
            {part "corr"
                {^ {s} {_corr mean8 "M"}}
                {'
                    {enterOver 8.2 0.6 write}
                    {becomeOver 9.2 0.6 {^ {s} {_corr mean16 "16"}}}
                    {_leaves}}}
            {part "W" {^ {s} big} {' {enterOver 11.0 0.8 write}}}
            {part "L" {^ {s} light} {' {enterOver 12.0 0.8 write}}}}
        {'}}]

The hook

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). P's candidates at stage its stage (`stepOf "weights" 13`, the clips below).
$[# risMath {: {^ {t} {playScore {_score {exampleTrace _seed 8} {exampleTrace _seed 16}}}} Math}]

Clips

The scene's steps as clips (lab/src/clip.rs): its demonstration's Play plays every step in order, a second each;
the story plays each over its sentence's words, and sets the scene back to a step where a beat starts.
